  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An innovative blush with a one-of-a-kind, pillowy-soft texture that delivers long-wearing, buildable, soft-matte color while blurring the look of pores.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Clover Flower Extract: Antioxidant-rich to create a soft-focus, blurred effect on skin.</p><p>- Powdered Ceramides and Botanical Glycerides: Skin-mimicking lipids lock in moisture for all-day soft-matte comfort.</p><p>- Memory Cloud Texture: Unique technology creates a pillowy-soft texture that transforms to powder.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Finger Application: <br>-Press or glide finger over the surface of Cloud Paint Plush Blush.<br>-Press formula gently into skin to apply where flush is desired.<br>-Use fingers to blend out across cheeks.<br><br>Brush Application: <br>-Swirl Cloud Paint Cheek Brush (sold separately) over the surface of Cloud Paint Plush Blush. <br>-Dab the brush on the area where flush is desired.<br>-Use the brush to blend out color as desired.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Clover Flower Extract: Antioxidant-rich to create a soft-focus, blurred effect on skin.<br>-Powdered Ceramides and Botanical Glycerides: Skin-mimicking lipids lock in moisture for all-day soft-matte comfort.<br>-Memory Cloud Texture: Unique technology creates a pillowy-soft texture that transforms to powder.<br><br>Dimethicone, Mica, Lauroyl Lysine, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Silica, Ceramide NP, Trifolium Pratense (Clover) Flower Extract, Tocopherol, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Cire de Carnauba, Glyceryl Dioleate, Triolein, Diisostearyl Malate, Hydrogenated Polycyclopentadiene, Isopentyldiol, Magnesium Stearate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Hexylene Glycol, Polyethylene, Alumina, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An innovative blush with a one-of-a-kind, pillowy-soft texture that delivers long-wearing, buildable, soft-matte color while blurring the look of pores.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Clover Flower Extract: Antioxidant-rich to create a soft-focus, blurred effect on skin.</p><p>- Powdered Ceramides and Botanical Glycerides: Skin-mimicking lipids lock in moisture for all-day soft-matte comfort.</p><p>- Memory Cloud Texture: Unique technology creates a pillowy-soft texture that transforms to powder.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Finger Application: <br>-Press or glide finger over the surface of Cloud Paint Plush Blush.<br>-Press formula gently into skin to apply where flush is desired.<br>-Use fingers to blend out across cheeks.<br><br>Brush Application: <br>-Swirl Cloud Paint Cheek Brush (sold separately) over the surface of Cloud Paint Plush Blush. <br>-Dab the brush on the area where flush is desired.<br>-Use the brush to blend out color as desired.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Clover Flower Extract: Antioxidant-rich to create a soft-focus, blurred effect on skin.<br>-Powdered Ceramides and Botanical Glycerides: Skin-mimicking lipids lock in moisture for all-day soft-matte comfort.<br>-Memory Cloud Texture: Unique technology creates a pillowy-soft texture that transforms to powder.<br><br>Dimethicone, Mica, Lauroyl Lysine, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Silica, Ceramide NP, Trifolium Pratense (Clover) Flower Extract, Tocopherol, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Cire de Carnauba, Glyceryl Dioleate, Triolein, Diisostearyl Malate, Hydrogenated Polycyclopentadiene, Isopentyldiol, Magnesium Stearate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Hexylene Glycol, Polyethylene, Alumina, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140).</div></details>",
